Homepage: https://github.com/azmykn/linux-audio-focus

Package: linux-audio-focus
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Description: Mobile-like audio focus manager for Linux desktops (MPRIS)
 Automatically pauses competing media players (YouTube in browsers,
 Spotify, VLC, local video players) when an incoming audio/voice stream
 plays (e.g. WhatsApp Web voice note in Chrome), and automatically resumes
 interrupted playback when the voice note finishes.
